{
  "_comment": "Map sources the robot UI offers (vitulus_ui, served as /api/map_sources). One entry per MapProxy layer in mapproxy.yaml: layer/grid/format must match it (the tile URL is /wmts/<layer>/<grid>/{z}/{x}/{y}.<format>). kind base = one at a time under the map, overlay = independent transparent layer on top. id is the stable key of the browser settings and of the alignment offset (offset_key: layers that share one georeference share one offset). max_zoom = finest level worth fetching, min_zoom = the source draws nothing below it. attribution: a string, or {en, cs} when it has words. layer_order (overlays): under = a tone right above the background map and UNDER the robot maps (relief), over = lines ON TOP of the robot maps (cadastre, contours).",
  "version": 1,
  "default_base": "sat",
